OL,3,AHow Met failed to stop rape-unit
OL,4,Adetective who abused women
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: Contains details of violence,
OL,7,Fcoercion and sexual abuse - and strong
OL,8,Flanguage
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police repeatedly
OL,11,Fmissed opportunities to stop a
OL,12,Fpredatory detective inspector from
OL,13,Fsexually exploiting women whose cases
OL,14,Fhe investigated, including one who
OL,15,Fmarried him and later died in
OL,16,Funexplained circumstances, BBC Panorama
OL,17,Fcan reveal.
OL,19,FWarren Arter used his position -
OL,20,Frunning a unit investigating sexual
OL,21,Fassaults in south-east London - to
OL,22,Ftarget women it was his job to protect.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
