OL,3,AHow the attack on Putin's prized
OL,4,ACrimean Bridge unfolded
OL,5,
OL,6,FStretching across the Kerch Strait in
OL,7,Fthe Black Sea, the Crimean Bridge was
OL,8,Falways a symbol: for Russia, a prestige
OL,9,Fproject cementing its claim to
OL,10,Fsovereign Ukrainian territory, and for
OL,11,FUkraine, a hated piece of
OL,12,Finfrastructure emblematic of Moscow's
OL,13,Foccupation of the Crimean Peninsula.
OL,15,FA key section of the double-arched,
OL,16,F12-mile-long bridge now lies on the
OL,17,Fseabed, brought down by an arsenal of
OL,18,FUkrainian long-range weaponry in a
OL,19,Fseven-stage operation culminating in a
OL,20,Fdramatic collapse.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
