OL,3,AUS loses measles elimination status
OL,4,Aafter 26 years amid record case numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter 26 years, the US has lost its
OL,7,Fstatus of having eliminated the highly
OL,8,Fcontagious measles virus, following two
OL,9,Fyears of record case numbers and
OL,10,Fdeaths.
OL,12,FThe Pan American Health Organization
OL,13,F(PAHO), a specialised service of the
OL,14,FUnited Nations, determined the US has
OL,15,Fhad uninterrupted transmission of the
OL,16,Fsame strain of measles for more than 12
OL,17,Fmonths.
OL,19,FStates have reported 10 measles-related
OL,20,Fdeaths this year, the most the country
OL,21,Fhas seen since the 1990s.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
